                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Supplementary protocol.</hi></head>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">Signed at Washington, December 5,
                        1910; ratification advised by the Senate, December 12, 1910; ratified by the
                        President, January 23, 1911; ratified by Mexico, December 21, 1910;
